#: roudix_store/ui.py
msgid ""
"This writes “roudix.flatpak.enable = true” to your local.nix, then rebuilds "
"the system (a few minutes). The Flathub catalog is then fetched and Roudix "
"Store has to be restarted for Flatpak to be picked up."
msgstr ""
"Cela écrit « roudix.flatpak.enable = true » dans ton local.nix puis "
"reconstruit le système (quelques minutes). Ensuite, le catalogue Flathub "
"sera récupéré et il faudra redémarrer Roudix Store pour que Flatpak soit "
"pris en charge."

